### Organization API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 기관 생성 (Create Organization)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "ORG001",
  "name": "서울대학교병원",
  "registrationNumber": "1234567890",
  "nursingNumber": "NURSE001",
  "branchCode": "BR001",
  "branchName": "본관",
  "employeeId": "EMP001",
  "employeeName": "홍길동",
  "employeePhone": "02-1234-5678",
  "type": "HOSPITAL"
}

### 2. 기관 목록 조회 (Get All Organizations)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3. 기관 상세 조회 (Get Organization by ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4. 기관 검색 (Search Organizations by Name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/search?name=서울
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5. 기관 정보 수정 (Update Organization)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "서울대학교병원 (수정)",
  "registrationNumber": "1234567890",
  "nursingNumber": "NURSE001",
  "branchCode": "BR001",
  "branchName": "본관",
  "employeeId": "EMP001",
  "employeeName": "홍길동",
  "employeePhone": "02-1234-5678",
  "type": "UNIVERSITY_HOSPITAL"
}

### 6. 기관 삭제 (Delete Organization)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/1

### 7. 중복 일련번호 체크 (Check Duplicate Serial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/check-serial/ORG001
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 8. 기관 생성 - 필수값 누락 (Validation Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "",
  "name": ""
}

### 9. 기관 생성 - 중복 일련번호 (Duplicate Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "ORG001",
  "name": "중복 병원"
}

### 10. 존재하지 않는 기관 조회 (Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/99999
Accept: {{contentType}}
